          <item row="5" column="0" colspan="2">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="lblDirHint">
            <property name="text">
             <string>Which grid a solve uses is derived from its mesh, never chosen. A symmetric hull at zero heel is meshed as a half vessel whose port side mirrors its starboard side, so half the circle is solved and the rest filled in exactly on delivery. Heel that same hull and the mesh is a full vessel with nothing to mirror — it needs the whole circle, or the delivered database is interpolated across what was never solved.</string>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
